1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Most people think you need a lot of money to start investing.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:11,200
That is completely wrong and I will show you why in a second.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:16,800
I made my first thousand dollars with twenty dollars and a phone.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:23,100
The reason nobody tells you this is that it is not exciting enough to sell.

5
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:29,600
You do not need leverage or a trading bot or any of that nonsense.

6
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:36,200
You need one boring habit repeated for about six months straight.

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:42,000
So that is the lesson. Boring wins. That is why most people quit.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,500
Now let me tell you about something completely different for a minute.

9
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:56,000
My uncle used to repair radios in a small shop near the river.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:04,000
He never made much money but he was happy, and I think about him often.
